    "title": "Ilhan Omar reveals details of federal raid",
    "text": "Ilhan Omar reveals details of federal raid\nRep. Ilhan Omar is sharing new details about an early morning federal raid on her Washington, D.C., home involving up to 25 agents. During an interview with MS Now, the Minnesota congresswoman called the search \"obnoxious\" and detailed the 17 items seized amid an investigation into her immigration paperwork. Omar maintains she did nothing wrong and revealed she plans to move due to ongoing death threats and safety concerns now that her address is public. FOX 9's Mike Manzoni has more.",
